---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement — AcePharm"
  description="AcePharm should work for every learner. We are working towards WCAG 2.2 AA and welcome reports of accessibility barriers."
>
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50/40 to-canvas border-b border-border-subtle text-center px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
        Accessibility Statement
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-primary font-semibold">AcePharm should work for every learner.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We are working towards WCAG 2.2 AA and welcome reports of accessibility barriers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-8 text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">1. Standards & Keyboard Navigation</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">All primary study flows, including the session builder, active question player, explanation sections, and flashcards, are fully operable using keyboard navigation (A–E, 1–3, Space, Enter) and screen readers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">2. Feedback & Reporting</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-muted">If you encounter any barrier when interacting with AcePharm, please contact us via our Contact form and we will review and resolve the issue promptly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
